SUMMARY:B/B+ Old Trolley Line Park to Mt Joy Loop (35R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride leader: Gavin Robe
 rtson**\n\n**Anticipated Average Pace: 16-19 mph**\n\n**Route: [https://ri
 dewithgps.com/routes/54772511](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54772511)**\
 n\nThis is a B/B+ level ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised 
 average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as 
 the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group toge
 ther with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at th
 e start.\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with
  the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself
  and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-19 mph average
  is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower r
 ide first.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a ba
 sic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo elimi
 nate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membershi
 p and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean y
 ou are a club member.\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbike
 club.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agre
 ement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://ww
 w.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nGuidanc
 e if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/
 content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144234
 70/
